# Rendering

- Overflow: normalize spaces → wrap lines → shrink font to min → refuse if still overflowing.
- Forbidden: move text boxes, widen zones, shrink below min, change layout.
- Images: png/jpeg/webp only; cover fit; no distortion; no upscale; reject SVG uploads.
- Export exact dimensions from template config (1080x1350 or 1080x1080).
